pdns (4.7.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  Upstream has renamed a number of configuration settings. You must
  manually update your pdns.conf and included configuration files.
  Backend schemas and data also need updates. SHA1 DS is deprecated.
  For backends supporting "dnssec" mode, I suggest turning it on.

  Please see the upstream upgrading guide at
    https://doc.powerdns.com/authoritative/upgrading.html

 -- Chris Hofstaedtler <zeha@debian.org>  Sat, 29 Oct 2022 18:21:49 +0000
